usage: todo [-h] [--db DB] {add,remove,rm,list} ...

A to-do list.

positional arguments:
  {add,remove,rm,list}  what to do
    add                 add an item
    remove (rm)         remove an item

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --db DB
---
usage: todo add [-h] [--priority PRIORITY] text

positional arguments:
  text

options:
  -h, --help           show this help message and exit
  --priority PRIORITY
